## 9. Autonomy Tier Mapping to MCP Operations

For the Symphony3-tier autonomy model (🟢 Auto /🟡 Supervised / 🔴 Human-required):

| Operation | Autonomy Tier | MCP Command | Confirmation Required? |
|-----------|--------------|-------------|----------------------|
| Search for existing pages/issues | 🟢 Auto | `confluence__searchContentUsingCql`, `jira__jqlAdvancedSearchTool` | No |
| Read page/issue details | 🟢 Auto | `confluence__aggGetPageById`, `jira__getIssue` | No |
| Create draft Confluence page | 🟡 Supervised | `ConfluenceCreationTool` | No (tool handles) |
| Create Jira issue | 🟡 Supervised | `JiraWorkItemCreateMinion` | Yes (action card) |
| Update Jira issue fields | 🟡 Supervised | `JiraWorkItemUpdateMinion` | Yes (action card) |
| Transition issue status | 🟡 Supervised | `JiraWorkItemUpdateMinion` | Yes (action card) |
| Add page labels | 🟢 Auto | `ActionToolAgent` | Platform-dependent |
| Restrict page access | 🔴 Human | `ActionToolAgent` | Yes |
| Archive page | 🔴 Human | `ActionToolAgent` | Yes |
| Delete/move page | 🔴 Human | `ActionToolAgent` | Yes |

