| `confluence__aggGetPageById` | Read existing template page content |
| `confluence__getPagesInSpace` | List pages in a space |
| `confluence__getPageDescendants` | Find child pages under a parent |
| `confluence__getChildPages` | Find direct children for placement |

**CQL Patterns for Template Discovery**:
```
type = page AND title ~ "PIR Template" AND space = "IMPIR"
type = page AND label = "model-card" AND space = "ML"
type = page AND title ~ "Weekly Digest" AND created >= now("-7d")
```

### How it applies to each document type:

| Document Type | Space Discovery | Parent Page Discovery | Labels |
|---------------|-----------------|----------------------|--------|
| Model Card | Search for "ml-engineering" or "MLP" space | Find "Model Cards" parent page | `model-card`, `ml-production` |
| PIR | Search for "incidents" or "IMPIR" space | Find "Post-Incident Reviews" parent | `pir`, `sev-{N}`, `ml-incident` |
| Weekly Digest | Search for team's space | Find "Weekly Digests" parent | `weekly-digest`, `ml-experiments` |
| Deployment Manifest | Search for "CentAI" or team space | Find "Deployments" parent | `deployment-manifest`, `ml-production` |
| Experiment Report | Search for "DTIE" or team space | Find "Experiments" parent | `experiment-report`, `ml-experiment` |

