|-----------|--------------|-----------|
| Read channel history | 🟢 Autonomous | No side effects |
| Post cadence reminder | 🟢 Autonomous | Low-risk, expected behavior |
| Post status update (from telemetry) | 🟡 Supervised | Content accuracy matters |
| Create incident channel | 🟡 Supervised | Structural change |
| Add responders | 🟡 Supervised | Personnel decision |
| Post severity escalation | 🔴 Human-confirmed | High impact, may page executives |
| Send external communications | 🔴 Human-confirmed | Customer-facing |

