```
IF severity escalates to Sev-1 or Sev-0:
  cadence_interval = 15 minutes (tighter)
  channel_create_message: "⚡ Cadence tightened to 15-min due to Sev-{n} escalation"
  
IF severity de-escalates:
  cadence_interval = 60 minutes (relaxed)
```

