## Executive Summary

This research investigates the Slack MCP tools and API capabilities available for implementing the 30-minute communication cadence required in SOP-3 (Production Incident Response). The findings cover the current tool inventory, the ActionToolAgent write capabilities, existing IMA bot patterns, and JSM ChatOps integration patterns that inform how an AI employee skill should orchestrate incident communication.

