## 5. Authentication & Scopes Required

Per [Bitbucket MCP Server Overview](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/BB/pages/6762426950/Bitbucket+MCP+Server+Overview+and+Support+Guide):

| Operation Category | Required Scopes |
|-------------------|----------------|
| Read repos/branches/files | `read:repository:bitbucket` |
| Read PRs | `read:pullrequest:bitbucket` |
| Create/merge PRs, add comments | `write:pullrequest:bitbucket` |
| Read pipelines/logs | `read:pipeline:bitbucket` |
| Trigger pipelines | `write:pipeline:bitbucket` (may also need `read:pipeline:bitbucket`) |
| Create/manage environments | `admin:pipeline:bitbucket` |
| Read user info | `read:user:bitbucket`, `read:account` |

**For the AI Employee**: The service account needs **all of the above scopes** to execute both SOPs autonomously (up to the autonomy gates).

