## 8. Switcheroo MCP Commands for Circuit Breaker (SOP-3 Context)

Based on [Switcheroo MCP tools now available](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/MEASURE/blog/2026/05/14/7033200353/Switcheroo+MCP+tools+now+available+in+Rovo+Dev+CLI):

| MCP Tool | API Endpoint | Use in SOP-3 |
|----------|-------------|-------------|
| `search_changes` | `GET /api/v2/statsig-change/search` | Find the `aiops_circuit_breaker_enabled` gate |
| `get_change_details` | `GET /api/v2/statsig-change/:id` | Get full CB state: rollout %, lifecycle, validation |
| `search_changelog` | `POST /api/v2/statsig-change/changeLog` | Audit: who changed CB during incident window |
| `search_target_apps` | `GET /api/v2/switcheroo/target-app` | Find target apps affected by CB state |

**CB Configuration (from runbook):**
```yaml
resilience4j.circuitbreaker:
  instances:
    ml-engine:
      slidingWindowType: TIME_BASED
      slidingWindowSize: 60
      minimumNumberOfCalls: 20
      failureRateThreshold: 20
      waitDurationInOpenState: 30s
      permittedNumberOfCallsInHalfOpenState: 20
      automaticTransitionFromOpenToHalfOpenEnabled: true
```

The Switcheroo gate URL: `https://switcheroo.atlassian.com/ui/gates/14ae760c-ba0f-4f8f-a62d-1ecd169737f1/key/aiops_circuit_breaker_enabled`

