## Executive Summary

This research investigates the Switcheroo MCP tool surface available for circuit breaker and feature gate activation in the context of SOP-3 (Production Incident Response). The findings reveal that **read operations are well-supported** via5 production MCP tools, and **creation operations** have recently been enabled (4 MCP tools in production as of May 25, 2026). However, **write/toggle/pause operations critical for incident response are NOT yet available as MCP tools** — they exist only as a PROPOSAL-stage REST API design. This is the key gap for SOP-3 automation.

---

## 1. Currently Available Switcheroo MCP Tools (Production)

### 1.1 Read-Only Tools (Live since May 14, 2026)

| MCP Tool Name | REST API Endpoint | Function | SOP-3 Relevance |
|---|---|---|---|
| `search_changes` | `GET /api/v2/statsig-change/search` | Search gates, dynamic configs, experiments by maintainer, kind, target app, status, capability | **HIGH** — Find circuit breaker gates by target app or capability during incident |
| `get_change_details` | `GET /api/v2/statsig-change/:id` | Get full state of a gate/experiment including lifecycle, rollout rules, peer-review state | **HIGH** — Inspect current state of CB gate before toggling |
| `search_changelog` | `POST /api/v2/statsig-change/changeLog` | Review recent events, optionally filtered by change, time window, or event type | **CRITICAL** — "Was a flag changed in the last 30 minutes that touches X?" |
| `get_experiment_reporting` | `GET /api/v2/switcheroo/experiment/:id/reporting` | Get experiment reporting metadata | LOW — Not directly relevant to incident CB |
| `search_target_apps` | `GET /api/v2/switcheroo/target-app` | Search and list target apps | MEDIUM — Discover which apps a CB gate targets |

**Source:** [Switcheroo MCP tools now available in Rovo Dev CLI](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/MEASURE/blog/2026/05/14/7033200353/Switcheroo+MCP+tools+now+available+in+Rovo+Dev+CLI)

### 1.2 Creation Tools (Live since May 25, 2026 — MEP-9601)

| MCP Tool Name | REST API Endpoint | Function | SOP-3 Relevance |
|---|---|---|---|
| `search_template` | `GET /api/v2/templates/search` | Search gate/experiment templates | LOW — Useful for pre-provisioning CB gates |
| `get_template` | `GET /api/v2/templates/:templateId` | Get full template details with fields | LOW |
| `create_gate` | `POST /api/v2/switcheroo/gate` | Create a new feature gate from template | MEDIUM — Pre-create kill switch gates |
| `create_experiment` | `POST /api/v2/switcheroo/experiment` | Create experiment from template | LOW |

**Source:** [MEP-9601: Switcheroo REST Endpoints — Planning & Progress](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/~709322507/pages/6806552579/MEP-9601+Switcheroo+REST+Endpoints+Planning+Progress)

### 1.3 Technical Details for Existing MCP Tools

- **Auth:** `service-proxy` with service/audience `flag-measurement-backend`
- **Response format:** Direct JSON — `.rows[]` for search/changelog, top-level object for details
- **Surfaces:** MCP Tool on ROVO and ROVO_DEV_CLI
- **Pagination:** `pageInfo` (totalCount, limit, offset)
- **Action IDs:**
  - Search Changes: `43de0fb3-fed7-44c6-8e15-10e0eb4e98d6`
  - Get Change Details: `159db884-1b61-4f7e-b230-e37df2f21d20`
  - Search Changelog: `137c6870-68cc-409d-ae37-6f3dcee8c0ec`

**Source:** [Switcheroo MCP](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/~70121a0bfb0f5f1d044559386861407284a15/pages/6791571538/Switcheroo+MCP)

