  "rollbackDetails": {
    "isDueToHot": true,
    "hotLink": "https://jira.atlassian.com/browse/HOT-12345",
    "impactedCapability": "search",
    "rollbackReason": "Performance degradation detected in production."
  }
}
```

**Status:** PROPOSAL stage — design reviewed by Jamie Williams, Sunny Kalsi, Maggie So, Ben Lucato. Implementation not yet started. Not yet registered as MCP tool.

