## 6. How This Applies to Skill/Tool Specifications

### 6.1 SOP-3: Production Incident Response

**Operations the AI employee invokes via Compass:**

| Step | Compass Operation | Parameters | What It Provides |
|------|-------------------|------------|------------------|
| Identify affected service | `atlassian:component:search` | `queryString=<service-name>`, `includeOnCallSchedules=true`, `includeDependsOn=true` | Component ID, owner team, on-call responders, downstream dependencies |
| Get runbook/documentation | `atlassian:component:get:documentation` | `componentId=<ARI>` | List of linked documents (runbooks, DR plans) |
| Check recent events | `atlassian:component:get:event-sources` | `componentId=<ARI>`, `eventFilters={"eventTypes":["DEPLOYMENT","INCIDENT"]}` | Recent deployments and incidents for correlation |
| Resolve team members | TWG `atlassian:graph:get:team-users` | `teamId=<ownerTeamARI>` | Full team member list for escalation |

**Autonomy tiering for SOP-3:**
- 🟢 **Autonomous**: Look up service ownership, get on-call, get dependencies, fetch runbook links
- 🟡 **Suggest + confirm**: Page on-call responder, escalate to secondary
- 🔴 **Human-required**: Declare major incident, invoke circuit breaker, post customer-facing status

### 6.2 Cost & Capacity Stewardship

**Operations the AI employee invokes via Compass:**

| Step | Compass Operation | Parameters | What It Provides |
|------|-------------------|------------|------------------|
| List team services | `getCompassComponents` / `search_components` | `ownerIds=[<teamARI>]` or `owner_team_names=["<team>"]` | All components owned by team |
| Check FinOps metadata | `getCompassComponent` (with custom fields) | `componentId=<ARI>` | Custom fields including FinOps cost centers, service group |
| Check operational hygiene | `search_components` | `has_link_types=["ON_CALL","DASHBOARD"]` | Which services have/lack on-call and dashboard links |
| Get component tier | `getCompassComponent` | `componentId=<ARI>` | Tier field (0-3) for cost prioritization |
| Audit service metadata | `getCompassCustomFieldDefinitions` | (none) | Available custom field definitions to validate completeness |

**Autonomy tiering for Cost Stewardship:**
- 🟢 **Autonomous**: Query service inventory, check metadata completeness, generate compliance reports
- 🟡 **Suggest + confirm**: Recommend tier changes, flag cost anomalies, propose migration candidates
- 🔴 **Human-required**: Actually modifyFinOps metadata, approve budget changes, trigger migrations

