Links stored on components represent operational context:

| Link Type | Purpose | SOP-3 Use | Cost Use |
|-----------|---------|-----------|----------|
| `ON_CALL` | On-call schedule URL | ✅ Identify who to page | ✅ Hygiene check |
| `DASHBOARD` | Monitoring dashboard | ✅ Quick triage | ✅ Hygiene check |
| `CHAT_CHANNEL` | Slack channel | ✅ Incident coordination | - |
| `REPOSITORY` | Source code repo | ✅ Revert PR lookup | - |
| `PROJECT` | Jira project | ✅ Issue creation | ✅ Tracking |
| `DOCUMENT` | Runbook/docs | ✅ Incident playbook | ✅ DR plans |
| `OTHER_LINK` | Microscope, Spinnaker, etc. | - | ✅ Platform metadata |

