**Source**: [Atlassian MCP Tool Names and Descriptions](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/~712020169287ede4ee471aa66d32db768989ee/pages/6029289235/Atlassian+MCP+Tool+Names+and+Descriptions), [Supported tools - Doc Update](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/mcp/pages/6809927090/Supported+tools+-+Doc+Update)

