## 4. Incident Response Metrics (TTD/TTH/TTR/TTM/TTC)

**Sources**:
- [Operational Metrics in Time of Incident - Definitions](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/SRE/pages/3036951819/Operational+Metrics+in+Time+of+Incident+-+Definitions)
- [PIR Changes Required to Support TTx Metrics](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/Spork/pages/5893427416/PIR+Changes+Required+to+Support+TTx+Metrics+Ease+of+Use)
- [SEV Review Template](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/SRE/pages/3023111932/SEV+Review+Template)

### 4.1 Metric Definitions (Atlassian-Official)

| Metric | Full Name | Calculation |
|--------|-----------|-------------|
| **TTD** | Time to Detect | Time from impact start to when the org is **aware** and has **acknowledged** the problem |
| **TTH** | Time to HOT | Time from Sev-2 breach to HOT creation (or HOT upgrade to Sev-2) |
| **TTM** | Time to Mitigate | Time from Sev-2 breach until Sev-2 impact is halted (no longer critical) |
| **TTR** | Time to Resolve | Time from detection to full resolution and service restoration |
| **TTC** | Time to Communicate | Time from HOT creation to first external communication |

### 4.2 SLO Targets at Atlassian

| Metric | Target |
|--------|--------|
| TTD | < 30 minutes (Detection from impact start) |
| TTH | < 25 minutes (HOT creation from major severity breach) |
| TTM | < 2 hours (Impact end from major severity breach) |
| TTC | < 30 minutes (From HOT Creation) |

### 4.3 PIR Metrics Table Template (for auto-generation)

```
| Metric Type | Result |
|-------------|--------|
| Detected by Monitoring? | Yes or No |
| TTD less than 30 minutes (Detection from impact start) | Yes or No |
| TTH less than 25 minutes (Hot creation from major severity breach) | Yes or No |
| TTM less than 2 hours (Impact end from major severity breach) | Yes or No |
| TTC less than 30 minutes (From Hot Creation) | Yes or No |
| Has this incident with similar root cause happened in the past12 months? | Yes or No |
| Root cause category field is filled and categorized accurately | Yes or No |
| Recovery by field is filled and categorized accurately | Yes or No |
| Preventable by field is filled and categorized accurately | Yes or No |
| Was progressive roll out and/or production change control followed? | Yes or No |
```

