## 5. Weekly Experiment Digest

### What It Is
A concise, high-signal weekly summary of ML experiment activity, model quality metrics, infrastructure health, and decisions made — designed to be consumable in<10 minutes. Bridges the gap between detailed experiment reports and leadership visibility.

### Internal Patterns Found

**Pattern 1: Weekly Digest Structure** (from [Teamwork Collection Weekly Digest](https://home.atlassian.com/o/2346a038-3c8c-498b-a79b-e7847859868d/s/a436116f-02ce-4520-8fbb-7301462a1674/project/ATLAS-103633)):

Guidelines:
- **Brief, high-signal updates** (wins, flags, escalations, FYI)
- **Links that quickly illustrate relevant work** (Loom <1m, screenshots, Figma)
- **Upcoming reviews/milestones**
- **Actions/Asks** from leadership or peers
- **Consumable in <10 minutes**

