## Executive Summary

This research synthesizes findings from Atlassian's internal ML Platform documentation, the AI Employee Strategy framework, and industry-standard drift detection methodologies to define the drift detection signals, retraining triggers, and autonomy tier classification for SOP-1 (Drift-Triggered Retraining). The findings are directly actionable for encoding into a SKILL.md workflow.

