│   ├─ Generate hypothesis from prior experiment insights│
│   ├─ Validate: falsifiable, measurable, directional               │
│   └─ Define: primary metric, MDE, guardrails, kill criteria       │
│                                                                    │
│ Step 2: LITERATURE & PRIOR-EXPERIMENT SYNTHESIS         [🟢 Auto]  │
│   ├─ Search: internal mlexp log, Confluence, ArXiv                │
│   ├─ Synthesize: structured table with evidence classification    │
│   ├─ Identify: gaps, contradictions, applicable principles│
│   └─ Quality gate: Quote accuracy ≥ 80%│
│                                                                    │
│ Step 3: PARALLEL ARCHITECTURE ORCHESTRATION             [🟡 Confirm]│
│   ├─ Generate: 5-10 workflow YAML variants                        │
│   ├─ Budget check: compute cost within approved envelope│
│   ├─ Launch: parallel ADHOC workflows in ML Studio                │
│   ├─ Monitor: auto-sync metrics, flag diverging runs              │
│   └─ Early-stop: kill runs exceeding budget or diverging          │
│                                                                    │
│ Step 4: MANDATORY ABLATION                [🟢 Auto]  │
│   ├─ Top-2 candidates from Step 3                                 │
│   ├─ Generate ablation condition matrix                           │
│   ├─ Execute: N≥3 runs per condition                              │
│   ├─ Compute: Layer Attribution Matrix, marginal lifts            │
│   └─ State: causal claims with evidence classification            │
│                                                                    │
│ Step 5: EXHAUSTIVE ERROR ANALYSIS                       [🟡 Confirm]│
│   ├─ Define taxonomy (before analyzing)│
│   ├─2-pass classification (automated + human review)             │
│   ├─ Pareto distribution, per-cohort breakdown                    │
│   ├─ Root cause deep-dive on top categories                       │
│   └─ Map to remediation: next hypothesis          │
│                                                                    │
│ Step 6: DECISION[🔴 Human] │
│   ├─ Statistical significance check│
│   ├─ Practical significance check (≥ MDE)                         │
│   ├─ Guardrail verification│
│   ├─ Decision: Ship / Iterate / Abandon                           │
│   └─ MANDATORY: Document negative results                         │
│                                                                    │
│ OUTPUT: Experiment Report (including negative results)             │
│→ Confluence page using Experiment Report template│
│   → mlexp log update with final metrics and tags                  │
│   → If shipping: trigger ML Launch Review Checklist (SOP-4)       │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

