## 4. Synthesis: Cost-Stewardship Skill Architecture

### Proposed Workflow for Cost-Stewardship SKILL.md

**Trigger conditions** (proactive, runs on cadence):
1. Weekly cost digest generation (aligned with TechOps)
2. Real-time anomaly response (SAVE ticket trigger)
3. Migration opportunity identification (monthly scan)
4. GPU utilization review (weekly)

**Autonomy tiers**:
| Action | Tier | Rationale |
|---|---|---|
