| Flag anomaly and draft investigation | 🟢 Autonomous | Saves time, no cost impact |
| Recommend rightsizing | 🟡 Suggest | Requires human judgment on workload patterns |
| Recommend migration priority | 🟡 Suggest | Requires human validation of technical constraints |
| Execute savings plan purchase | 🔴 Escalate | Financial commitment, requires leadership approval |
| Shut down idle endpoints | 🔴 Escalate | Production risk, requires service owner confirmation |
| Modify GPU reservations | 🔴 Escalate | Capacity impact, requires team sign-off |

