**Source**: [[Model Name] Template](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/jai/pages/5780593452/Model+Name+Template)

**Structure**:
- **Modeling**: Goal, Approach, ML Tooling, Data Sources, Assumptions
- **Data Preparation**: Sample Selection, Labels, Features, Preparation Process
- **Evaluation**: Offline Metrics, Online Metrics
- **Model Operation**: (deployment, monitoring details)

**Classification**: **Skill-encodable** (Reporting skill populates this template structure for Model Card reports)

### 5.2 AI Eval Resource Stocktake — Templates Needed

**Source**: [AI Eval Resource Stocktake](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/PMC/pages/6627649105/AI+Eval+Resource+Stocktake)

