- Golden Dataset planning template
- Eval Rubric template (with binary decision framing)
- LLM-as-Judge prompt template (role, question, standard, boundary examples)
- Quality Scorecard template

**Classification**: **Skill-encodable** (these represent report output formats the Digital MLE generates)

