Triggering surface (offline/adhoc/released → 6-stage):

 • rovo-eval (ConvoAI multi-turn): run_offline_eval 🟢, run_shadow_eval 🟡,
   run_ab_eval 🔴, fetch_run 🟢, emit_to_lens 🟢
 • AIX-eval (pythonic ML-Studio): run_offline 🟢, run_production_slice 🟡
