   """Resilient moderation pipeline — wraps inference with error handling.      
                                                                                
   ``ResilientPipeline`` wraps any ``Moderator`` and catches                    
   inference errors, converting them to either a fail-open ALLOWED result       
   or an ``APIException`` depending on the current feature-flag state.          
                                                                                
   This replaces the old ``inference_error_handler`` context manager —          
   all error-handling logic for moderation inference lives here.                
   """                                                                          
