## For Each Skill (SKILL.md)

Produce a complete SKILL.md file and write it to `/Users/tchen7/MyProjects/CoreProjects/OpenStartup/_runtime/tasks/role_setup/role_setup_20260526_061914_c3414998/children/worker_1/children/aggregator/outputs/skills/<skill-name-kebab-case>/SKILL.md`. Do NOT also write a flat `/Users/tchen7/MyProjects/CoreProjects/OpenStartup/_runtime/tasks/role_setup/role_setup_20260526_061914_c3414998/children/worker_1/children/aggregator/outputs/SKILL.md` — only the subdirectory path. The file MUST start with YAML frontmatter:
```yaml
---
name: <skill-name-kebab-case>
